            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While the bearer is leading a unit, models in that unit have a 5+ invulnerable save.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Ancestral Imperative" id="b080-e5ad-0d78-abfd" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While this model is leading a unit, models in that unit have ^^LETHAL HITS^^ on melee attacks. Each time a model in that unit makes any attack, they reroll hit rolls of 1 and may ignore any modifiers to hit of their choice.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Supreme Kin-Warlord" id="1c04-487b-c617-e2f6" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the start of your Command phase, select one friendly ^^**Leagues of Votann Infantry**^^ unit within 12&quot;: That unit gains both Hostile Acquisition and Fortify Takeover until the start of your next Command phase. If this model is in your army, it must be your ^^**Warlord**^^.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Leader" id="eb08-e1fc-f23f-9dd7" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">This model can be attached to the following units:
- EINHYR HEARTHGUARD
- HEARTHKYN HAMMERSHIELDS
- HEARTHKYN WARRIORS</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
