        <profile name="Brôkhyr Guild Support" id="cdfc-1a74-07f4-fd78" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While this unit is within 3&quot; of one or more friendly ^^**Leagues of Votann Vehicle**^^ or ^^**Ironkin Steeljacks**^^ units, it has the [LONE OPERATIVE] ability</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Architect of the Hold" id="8713-58a4-7665-b3eb" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the start of your Command phase, select one friendly ^^**Leagues of Votann Vehicle**^^ unit within 3&quot; of this model. Until the start of your next Command phase, that unit gains one of the following benefits: 


Calibrated Fire Solutions: Improve the Armour Penetration characteristic of that unit’s ranged weapons by 1.
Optimized Actuators: Add 1&quot; to Move and +1 to Advance rolls. 
Reinforced Plating: Improve the Save characteristic of that unit by 1 (to a maximum of 2+).</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Leader" id="5ce1-0fb8-3247-16fb" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">This model can be attached to the following unit:
- HEARTHKYN WARRIORS
- BRÔKHYR THUNDERKYN</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Invulnerable Save" id="c6ef-3015-5cb5-5bf3" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
