              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Once per battle, at the end of your opponent&apos;s Fight phase, if the bearer is on the battlefield, it can use this Enhancement. If it does, select one ^^**Hernkyn^^** unit from your army, and, for every 2YP you just spent, select up to one additional ^^**Hernkyn^^** unit from your army. You can remove those units from the battlefield and place them into Strategic Reserves. You cannot select a unit that is within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units (excluding assailed units).</characteristic>
