                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Each time a model in this unit makes an attack, add 1 to the Hit roll if this unit is below its Starting Strength. In addition, add 1 to the Wound roll if this unit is Below Half-strength.</characteristic>
