                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">The first time the bearer is destroyed, roll one D6 at the end of the phase: on a 2+, set the bearer back up on the battlefield as close as possible to where it was destroyed and not within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units, with 3 wounds remaining.</characteristic>
