                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While units from your Crusade army have Hostile Acquisition, each time an attack is allocated to the bearer, subtract 1 from the Damage characteristic of that attack. While units from your Crusade army have Fortify Takeover, each time an attack is allocated to the bearer, change the Damage characteristic of that attack to 1.</characteristic>
