                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Until your Crusade force next completes an expedition, each time you roll to determine the fundamental resource gained or the amount of resources gained, subtract 1 from the roll, to a minimum of 1.</characteristic>
