              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Once per battle round, one unit from your Crusade army with this ability can use this ability when it is selected to Advance. If it does, do not make an Advance roll for that unit. Instead, until the end of the phase, add 12&quot; to the Move characteristic of models in that unit.</characteristic>
