                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Each time the bearer&apos;s unit destroys an enemy unit, at the end of the battle you gain 10 Biomatter. If that was a **^^Monster^^** unit, you gain 20 Biomatter instead. If that unit was a **^^Vehicle^^** unit, you gain 20 Raw Materials instead. In addition, you gain 20 Energy Sources if that unit was equipped with a Relic.</characteristic>
