                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">**^^Kâhl^^** or **^^Grimnyr^^** model only. Once per battle, at the start of the Fight phase, the bearer can unveil this Relic. If it does, every enemy unit within 18&quot; of the bearer gains 1 Judgement token, and until the end of the phase, add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of melee weapons equipped by models in the bearer&apos;s unit.
***Data Author Note: Judgement tokens were removed with the release of the codex.***</characteristic>
